<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1TU - Bible Iyansi</book>
  <para style="h">1 TUMÀTƐ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Un'kaan atàtwɛb akà Tumàtɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 TUMÀTƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Un'kaan atàtwɛb akà</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tumàtɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Nsɛmà</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan atàtwɛb akà Tumàtɛ Pɔl kàsön kà isii a 64 - 65 ungö a Yɛsu Klistɔ, u Masɛdwan a Filipe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl kàmɛn mpay ntɔn Ikööŋ kàsɛmà nde u Ɛfɛsɔ, anà baar kàyisälà nde anà ba. Mpay ande yà naa u Ɛfɛsɔ yàkäl anà ndwà a nzam a itɛk anà an'lɔɔŋ a loor. Kyakin kàkwen nde muswaŋ isal ande akà mbuur a balàbal, wàŋàbuul mpem, awà kan'kwo mutüüb anà nde ntɔn mukyer isal mulɔŋ Ikööŋ a Nzam.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isal abi nde kàkyer a Tumàtɛ, un'lɔŋki ande wà lää. Taarànde kàkäl Ungɛlɛki, ngwän kàkäl Un'yudà awà kàbulà un'klistɔ. Pɔl kàkwen naa Tumàtɛ udübà mun a baar a an'lɔɔŋ a loor anà ulɔŋ Ndaa a ndandaa. Baar bàkwen mukyer isal a ikyɛɛŋ, ba ban'sɔɔl isal a ntsà, muswaŋ nkääl a asyääl anà aseey. Tumàtɛ kàkäl umbɛy. Pɔl kàkwen naa baar bàkɔɔn un'bɛy, wɛɛ nde ukäl mbaan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Un'kaan awà wàŋàyilà abà: - 1.1-2: Mbɔr - 1.3-11: An'lɔɔŋ a bunàbun mà Un'kɔɔn - 1.12-20: Imbäl ande - 2.1-3.13: Mɔ̈ɔ̈ a Ikööŋ - 3.14-4.5: An'lɔɔŋ a loor - 4.6-6.19: Asyääl a Nzam - 6.20-21: Ntsülà.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbɔr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Mɛ Pɔl, ntööm a Klistɔ Yɛsu unsà nswɛɛŋ a Nzam awà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi anà Klistɔ Yɛsu awà làkyän abi.<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Akà ngye Tumàtɛ, mwan amɛ wàndandaa unsà làkwikilà: Wɛy Taaràbi Nzam anà Mwol abi Klistɔ Yɛsu bapɛ kab angway, ndwääl a nkul anà duu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikyɛɛŋ ntɔn an'lɔɔŋ a loor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Mulab nswɛɛŋ kapɛ mɛ umpal kàlwomà mɛ u Masɛdwan, sàkal u Ɛfɛsɔ, ntɔn mutsuŋ baar bamwɛy mukɔɔn alɔŋ ndaa asin <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>anà mukɔɔn alab in'sim anà in'lwaaŋ mpa ifàtsü: mya myàfàtwaal nsyeel a mbaaŋ kikal mulab ukwen a Nzam abà bàfàkwo unsà làkwikilà. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Isin a nswɛɛŋ ayi kyà ukwen bàfàfà u mpem aŋàpɔŋà, unsà an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ anà làkwikilà a ndandaa. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Bumwɛy bàsàwɛy indiir abi, waa bàdiimà mbwo, bàkyàbulà muyisà in'lɔn ikɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Ba bàfàkyey uyɔl naa ba bà alɔɔŋ a Un'kɔɔn, wɛɛ ba bàyöb anki itàkal indiir bàfàtɛn ba, itàkal ntɔn ndaa bàfàkyään ba a uyɔl banswà.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Bi ikyàyöb naa Un'kɔɔn wà ubwaŋ isàkal naa wa ban'syääl u mbwo aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Làyöb naa Un'kɔɔn bàkyer anki ntɔn ŋabalàbal, wɛɛ ntɔn aŋunkwɛm anà baar un'tswe ngwal, ntɔn baar mpa bàfàlab in'kɔɔn, baar abye anà mpem a kɔɔrà anà aŋaman'be, ntɔn baar bàfàbɛy Nzam anà indiir in'kyɛɛl, ntɔn baar bàfàdwa bàtaaràba anà bàngwän, ntɔn adwää baar anà <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>baar a ŋingyäy, ntɔn abaal bàfàbir ba a ba anà akaar bàfàbir ba a ba, ntɔn atɛɛl a yà a asɔ anà aŋaloor, ntɔn aŋimbäl a loor anà baar bàfàkyer undiir asin mpa ufàlab an'lɔɔŋ in'kyɛɛl. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>An'lɔɔŋ amà mà uboo a Làsaŋ Aŋàbwaŋ alà ban'pɛ, alà làfü akà Nzam a làkɔɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'tɔɔn ntɔn ubwaŋ a Nzam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Mɛ kan'fuur an'tɔɔn mbɔɔn akà Mwol abi Klistɔ Yɛsu awà kan'pɛ ngwal aŋàkwo, ntɔn nde kan'si mpem mpal kan'wɛl nde unsà isal ande, <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>mɛ mbuur kàkäl ŋambɛɛy, ŋamɛɛy a nkwaaŋ anà un'too a in'tswe. Wɛɛ nde kan'wem ngyɛb, ntɔn mɛ kàyöbà anki indiir kàkyɛrà mɛ ntɔn mɛ kàkäl anki anà làkwikilà. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Kab a ngway a Mwol abi làkäl aŋàsöönà akà mɛ, anà làkwikilà anà ukwen abà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Ayi ndaa a làkwikilà ban'kwo baar banswà musà u mpem anà bàkyey ya naa Klistɔ Yɛsu kàyi u mɛɛn ntɔn mutswà bàŋan'be banswà mɔ̈ɔ̈. Mɛ, mɛ in'wà wàtàtwɛb uboo a ba. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Wɛɛ ntɔn abà, mɛ ban'wem ngyɛb, naa amu mɛ, mbuur atàtwɛb, Klistɔ Yɛsu uswɛŋ nkääŋ a mpem ande yanswa, asànaa mbaan ntɔn baar bàsàsà làkwikilà amu nde ntɔn mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Akà Mfum a mbul a in'tye, mpa afàkwà, mpa afàmɛnà u mii, awà nde mpɛl Nzam, wɛy nsyäŋà anà làkoo ikäl anà nde ipepey! Abwɛy!<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Mwan amɛ Tumàtɛ, le nswɛɛŋ amapà mɛ asànaa ngɔɔm bàtɛ itaan ntɔn ngye. Wɛy ndaa ayi ikäl ngwal a ngye unsà ità angye kyà ntsà, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>kaar làkwikilà anà an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ. Bumwɛy bàkyàpiy an'kyän amà. Abun làkwikilà aba sye làkyàkyà bwà. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Uboo a baar abà bà Imɛnɛ anà Alɛksandre abà kàkäb mɛ akà Satanà ntɔn ba bàlɔŋkà mukɔɔn afàbɛy.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ ntɔn ngyamàkà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Kusà a indiir byanswà, mɛ kan'swaŋ naa bàtwab atàsà ndɔ̈ɔ̈m, ngyamàkà, mbɔ̈ɔ̈n, an'tɔɔn ntɔn baar banswà, <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>ntɔn amfum, anà baar abye anà ikɔ̈b, ntɔn bi ikäl anà mɔ̈ɔ̈ aŋàtɔlà mpem, wà duu unsà inzaam anà uyɔl banswà. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Abi indiir a ntsà ufàkyey Nzam awà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ abi, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>awà akwen naa baar banswà bàwü mɔ̈ɔ̈ anà bàtöl muyɔ̈b ndandaa. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Ntɔn Nzam wà mwɛy, mfurboo mwɛy mpɛl uboo a Nzam anà baar, baal Klistɔ Yɛsu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>awà kàpɛ mɔ̈ɔ̈ ande ŋàkwo asànaa nkwiy ntɔn baar banswà. Abun, nde kàtɛ imbäl, umpal làkwe taaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Ntɔn abun mɛ, mɛ Nzam kan'si mukäl un'kyeey anà ntööm, un'lɔɔŋ a baar mpa abà Ayudà unsà làkwikilà anà ndandaa. Mɛ in'tà anki loor, wɛɛ mɛ an'tɛn ndandaa.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Abun, mɛɛ in'kwen naa abaal bàyamà kikal kyanswà, bàsɛɛn an'kɔɔ in'kyɛɛl u du, ukɔɔn nkyɛl anà an'sye.<verse eid="1TI 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Ntɔn akà akaar, wɛy ba bàbwäär ipfɛy aŋàbwaŋ mpa ipà nswɛn, ikɔɔn akal anà ntwɛn mbɔɔn. Wɛy ba bàkɔɔn atɔŋ ntswe, bàkɔɔn abwaar indiir a wɔl, an'yak, itàkal ipfɛy a ntal mbɔɔn, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>wɛɛ, isal aŋàbwaŋ byan'kwo ntɔn akaar bàfàkyään inzaam. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Wɛy un'kaar uwɛl an'lwɛŋ a duu anà unkyeey wanswà.<verse eid="1TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Mɛ, mɛ impà anki mbwo akà un'kaar mulɔŋ, itàkal muwal ikɔ̈b udu a abaal. Wɛy nde ukäl unsà duu. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Ntɔn ya yà naa bàtàboom Adam kusà, Ɛva ungö. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Waa kà Adam anki bàkür, wɛɛ un'kaar, ungö bun'kür, nde kàbü u man'be. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Itàkal abun, nde asàwà mɔ̈ɔ̈ u mbwo a mböör a baan, isàkal naa nde wà uboo a làkwikilà, ukwen, un'kyɛɛl anà unsà làbɔ̈ɔ̈n.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Aseey a Ikööŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Ndaa yi yà ndandaa: kya mbuur usàkal anà ngyal a isal a ikyɛɛŋ a Ikööŋ, nde kan'sɔɔl isal a ntsà. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Un'kyɛɛŋ a Ikööŋ akal mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n ifà ibe, un'dim a un'kyay mwɛy mpɛl, mbuur mpa awà ngaal, mbuur a duu, ŋambwäär aŋàbwaŋ, ŋun'kaay, mbuur kan'kwo mulɔŋ, <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>mpa awà un'yöör a man anà un'nwään a ngwiy, wɛɛ nde akal mbuur a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà ŋun'tüüb, mbuur mpa afàkwen ngim mbɔɔn. <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>Wɛy nde ukäl aŋàkwo muyaal ndwà ande ŋàkwo anà mukyer naa baan ande bàkäl unsà unkyeey anà làzir lanswà. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Lalan, kya mbuur uyöb anki muler ndwà ande ŋàkwo, nde ayàkwo aben muler Ikööŋ a Nzam? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Nde ukwo anki mukal mbuur akün unsà mbuul a mpem, naa tɛy, nde ayàsɛɛn an'pɛy, waa uyàwal mbar asànaa kàwɛl ileŋ. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Wɛy sye naa baar abà u nsà a Ikööŋ bun'tɛɛl imbäl aŋàbwaŋ, ntɔn nde ukɔ̈ɔ̈n abwà u nswɛn anà unsà intaam a ileŋ.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asyääl a Ikööŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Ifà imwɛy sye, asyääl bàkal baar a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n anà bà mpem mwɛy. Ba bàkal anki ayɔ̈ɔ̈r a man anà baar bàfàkal anà ilään a bweel a nswɛn. <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>Wɛy ba bàkäär ngyee a làkwikilà unsà an'kyän aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Yubwaŋ naa bàtwab atàsi, ungö, isàkal naa undiir un'be bàmɛn anki amu ba, apan waa ba bàsal. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Akaar sye bàkal baar a làbɔ̈ɔ̈n, mpa bàfàtwee, baar a duu, bàfasyeel mpem unsà indiir byanswà. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Asyääl a Ikööŋ abaal bàkal adim a un'kyay mwɛy mpɛl anà bàkyer ayöb muyaal baan aba anà ndwà aba ŋakwo. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Ntɔn asyääl bàfàkyer isal aba ubwaŋàbwaŋ bàfàwal làkoo anà uyɔl byan'fà unsà làkwikilà amu Klistɔ Yɛsu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngyee a kölàköl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Amasöön mɛ indiir abi, ntɔn mɛ an'sà làkyän naa mɛ in'kyer ayàlaler ungö a kitaaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Itàkal abun, kya mɛ in'sàlam muyà, ngye akyer ayàyɔ̈b naa nkääl angye ikal aben u ndwà a Nzam, ayà Ikɔ̈ɔ̈ŋ a Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈, ta a ndwà anà un'käär a ndandaa. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Ukɔɔn mbaaŋ, Ngyee unsà inzaam yà kölàköl! Klistɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">kàyàmɛnà asànaa mbuur,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Dweelà In'kyɛɛl kun'twey wàbalàbal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">nde kàyàmɛnà akà akyeey a Nzam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Nde bàkyään akà in'sɛŋ myumwɛy,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">bun'si làkwikilà u mɛɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">nde bun'sɛɛn unsà làkɔɔ!<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ an'be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Dweelà làtɛɛnà ubwaŋàbwaŋ naa kan'taaŋ a ntsüü, amwɛy bàsàpiy làkwikilà ntɔn mulab an'dweelà a loor anà an'lɔɔŋ man'fà akà insɔŋà. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Mpem yweel a baar a loor isabwiy ndwaŋ. An'kyän aba màŋàbwà bwoor. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Baar aban bàfàtsuŋ baar mutà bɔr anà mudyà isaa byumwɛy. Wɛɛ Nzam bya kàkyer ntɔn aŋàlàkwikilà abà bàyöb ndandaa ubwaŋàbwaŋ bàdi bya unsà mfuur a an'tɔɔn. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Ntɔn indiir byanswà kàkyer Nzam byàŋàbwaŋ, undiir a piy bwà watɛy isàkal naa wa ban'wal unsà mfuur a an'tɔɔn, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>ntɔn wa wàŋàkyɛɛl u mbwo a Ndaa a Nzam anà ngyamàkà.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Un'syääl a Klistɔ Yɛsu wàŋàbwaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Kyään indiir abi akà atɔŋ: abun ngye ayàkal un'syääl a Klistɔ Yɛsu wàŋàbwaŋ, wàŋàyuur a ndaa a làkwikilà anà an'lɔɔŋ a ntsà kàläb ngye ubwaŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Tɔn nsim mpa ifàlab làkwikilà, itaŋà a anün akaar. Wɛɛ lɔŋàkà inzaam. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>An'taam mupà ndür ngwal mà mfun unsà indiir ikikye, wɛɛ inzaam kyà mfun unsà indiir byanswà. Ntɔn kya ifàpà ilää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ aŋàbà anà kyà mɔ̈ɔ̈ ayàyà. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Ndaa ayi yà ndandaa ayà ban'kwo baar banswà musyeel mpem. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Lalan, isàkal naa bi imanà mpay anà inwaanà ntɔn ya, ntɔn bi kàkyàsà làkyän amu Nzam a mɔ̈ɔ̈ awà Un'tswää a mɔ̈ɔ̈ a baar banswà, sin sin aŋàlàkwikilà.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Swaŋ indiir abi anà lɔŋ bya. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Wɛy mbuur mwɛy ukɔ̈ɔ̈n abɛy imbɛy angye! Wɛɛ ngye kal mbaan akà aŋàlàkwikilà u ntɛɛn, u nkääl, unsà ukwen, u làkwikilà, anà u mpem aŋàbwaŋ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Apà in'yàyà mɛ, sà muküünà mutaŋ Ndaa Aŋàsɔn, mulɛɛl anà mulɔŋ. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Twon an'bɛy kab a ngway alà amu ngye, alà bapɛ u mbwo a ngɔɔm anà nsyeel a an'kɔɔ a andweer. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Pà mpem angye unsà indiir abi, pà mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye wanswà unsà isal angye, waa baar banswà bàyàman naa isal angye kyàmukyà usà. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Kal kà igyɛɛŋ ntɔn ngye ŋakwo anà ntɔn alɔɔŋ angye. Kal aŋàtsim unsà indiir abi byanswà. Kya ngye asàkyer abun, ngye ayàtswà mɔ̈ɔ̈ angye ŋakwo anà wà baar bàfaweem.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsyääl ntɔn aŋàlàkwikilà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Twon aŋän a ngwal baal aŋànün, wɛɛ un'lɛɛl asànaa taaràŋà. Awɛl atö asànaa atɔŋ, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>andweer akaar asànaa bàmaa, asyee asànaa ampääŋ, unsà mpem aŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Asyäŋà akweel adim, akweel adim abà bàndandaa aŋàyen. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Wɛɛ, isàkal naa un'kweel un'dim mwɛy we anà baan itàkal atil, wɛy ba bàtwab atàlɔŋkà musyääl làkwikilà aba u ndwà aba ŋakwo anà mufuur ibay akà aböör aba. Awà undiir ufàkyey Nzam. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Un'kweel un'dim a ndandaa awà aŋàyen, afàsà làkyän ande amu Nzam. Nde afàsin aküünà u ndɔ̈ɔ̈m anà u ngyamàkà mpib anà mwäänà. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Wɛɛ, wunà akwà afàsyääl ilään a ndür, nde wàŋàkwà itaan, itàkal naa nde wà anà mɔ̈ɔ̈. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Le indiir atsuŋ ngye ba, ntɔn ba bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n apɛl. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Isàkal naa mbuur ufàbay anki atɔŋ ande, sin sin baar a ndwà ande, nde kan'kɔɔb làkwikilà ande, nde kan'söön mbuur akɔ̈ɔ̈n làkwikilà unsà ube.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Musɔn ikɔb a un'kaar unsà itsuŋ a akweel adim, nde akal àŋàkölà mbul an'kwem an'syaam, anà kàkäl un'kyay a un'dim mwɛy mpɛl. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Wɛy nde ukäl un'kaar awà bàyöb isal ande byà ntsà: kàbɔɔŋ baan ande ubwaŋàbwaŋ, kàfawalà baar u ndwà ande, kàfaywɛyà in'kɔl a aŋàlàkwikilà, kàbayà aŋangyɛb anà kàfakyerà undiir wanswà wàŋàbwaŋ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Wɛɛ akà akweel adim abà asyee, twon an'kyey mukasɔn. Ntɔn, umpal ifàsɛnà ilään a ndür aba, ya ifasiinà mufàbääl, waa bàkɔɔb Klistɔ, <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>abun, ba ban'bwà unsà ikwàndwà ntɔn ban'bɛy ba kyään aba làtàtwɛb. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Apan sye, ntɔn ubwal, ba bàfàlɔŋkà muyikyà ndwà a ndwà. Yan'söön ube, ba kà nà abwal mpɛl anki, wɛɛ sye baar a itetɛɛn anà bà mun ipɔl. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Abun, mɛ in'kwen naa akweel adim abà asyee bàtɛ bɔr, bàbör baan, bàyaal ndwà aba anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n apà abör mbwo atwee. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Ntɔn amwɛy amu ba bàfuràtàdiimà mbwo ntɔn mulab Satanà. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Isàkal naa ŋàlàkwikilà mwɛy we anà akweel adim u ywar ande, wɛy nde kabay, waa buur bàkɔɔn akal udu a Ikööŋ, ntɔn Ikööŋ ikwe mubay akweel adim abà ndandaa aŋàyen.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Andweer bàfàler Ikööŋ ubwaŋàbwaŋ ban'kwo muwal nsyäŋà mbalà yweel, sin sin ba akwà bàfàwal buur a kölàköl unsà Ndaa anà an'lɔɔŋ. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Abun, Ndaa Aŋàsɔn itɛɛnà naa: « Twon an'bäm mun a ngɔɔmà utaaŋ undyarà wa mbɛŋ » anà: « Un'syääl an'kwo muwal làfur ande. » <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Twon an'kyey mfüün ntɔn un'dweer ukɔɔn imbäl a baar bɔ̈ɔ̈l itàkal atär. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Baar ban'kyer man'be, aŋän u mii a baar banswà, ntɔn bumwɛy sye bàmɛn bɔɔmà.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Mɛ amalɔɔm umii a Nzam, u mii a Klistɔ Yɛsu anà u mii a akyeey in'kyɛɛl: lab indiir abi ukɔɔn nkyɛɛr anà ukɔɔn un'kɔl aŋàyɔŋ. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Twon an'düül musà mbuur an'kɔɔ, twon an'bilà unsà man'be a mbuur asin. Ngye ŋakwo kal wàŋàpöŋà.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Wɛy munwà an'dà mpɛl, wɛɛ nwà sye ndam a man, ntɔn kwiy angye anà an'kyal angye taaŋ lanswà.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Man'be a baar amwɛy màfàmɛnà kusà mutsul mbar, wɛɛ akà bumwɛy, ma màfàmɛnà ungöngö. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Abun sye, isal a ntsà byàkyer afàmɛnà, itàkal bya akwà mpa byàfàmɛnà agyä byàkwo anki musin akalà byàŋàyee.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Wɛy baar banswà abà asɔ bàkyey naa ankum aba ban'kwo muwal nsyäŋà aŋàkwo, ntɔn mbuur ukɔ̈ɔ̈n abɛy ikɔb a Nzam anà an'lɔɔŋ abi. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Isàkal naa ankum aba bà aŋàlàkwilà, ba bàkwo anki mukabɛy naa ntɔn ba bà atɔŋ. Wɛɛ, wɛy ba basyääl aŋàsöön ubwaŋ, ntɔn baar bàwal bweel a nsyääl aba yàŋàbwaŋ bà aŋàlàkwikilà anà nkween. Indiir abi lɔŋ bya anà swaŋ bya.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">An'lɔɔŋ a loor anà in'naaŋ a ndandaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Isàkal naa mbuur kan'lɔŋ ndaa asin, anà kan'kɔɔn alab ndaa a ndandaa a Mwol abi Klistɔ Yɛsu anà an'lɔɔŋ a inzaam, <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>nde wàŋàyɔl a uyɔl, wà insil, wà ŋukyal ntɔn nsyeel a mbaaŋ anà ngwiy a ngɔk, indiir byàfàtwaal un'köl, an'sye, in'tswe, an'kyän an'be, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>anà mbaaŋ mpa ifàtsü uboo a baar aŋun'yɛnà aŋàkalà, mpa abye anà ndandaa. Ba bàfàsi naa inzaam kyà mbwo muwal bweel.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Yà ndandaa naa inzaam kyà bweel a kölàköl akà mbuur afàman un'sak unsà indiir awe nde abya. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Ntɔn bi kàtwääl anki akundiir mwɛy u mɛɛn mà, bi sye ikwe anki mufàsyen undiir kan'fà mwo. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Abun, isàkal naa bi ibye anà isaa anà ipfɛy, bya byan'kwo ntɔn bi. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Wɛɛ akà baar bàfàkwen mukal aŋin'naaŋ, ba bàfàbwà u ndɛb, unsà untaam, anà unsà in'lään mbɔɔn myà upool anà myube, amyà ifàmiin baar u mpay anà kukwà. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Ntɔn ukwen a ngim bisin a mpay yanswà. Bamwɛy bàbilà afwee mwo, bàkyàdiimà mbwo a làkwikilà, anà bàkyàpɛɛl usaay mbɔɔn ba ŋakwo.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nswɛɛŋ akà Tumàtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Wɛɛ ngye, mbuur a Nzam, tiin indiir abi, waa aleŋ balàbal, inzaam, làkwikilà, ukwen, nkääŋ a mpem, duu. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Nwan ità aŋàbwaŋ kyà làkwikilà. Kaar mɔ̈ɔ̈ a mbul a in'tye awà babel mukyey mpal kàtɛ ngye imbäl a ntsà kyà làkwikilà u mii a ambäl mbɔɔn. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Mɛ amaswaŋ u mii a Nzam awà afàpà mɔ̈ɔ̈ akindiir byanswà, anà u mii a Klistɔ Yɛsu awà kàtɛ imbäl ande kyà ntsà u mii a Pɔnsi Pilatu naa: <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Lab nswɛɛŋ ukɔɔn mbiin anà ukɔɔn pɛl, tii mpal usyemɛnà Mwol abi Yɛsu Klistɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Mɛɛnà ayi isàkal u taaŋ kàsi ŋun'sak, awà nde mpɛl udu a indiir byanswà, Mfum a amfum, Mwol a amwol. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Nde mpɛl mpà afàkwà, awà afàkal u pɛɛlà mwɛy mpa kan'kwo mbuur mwɛy musin tsütsü apà la. Akà mbuur mwɛy kun'mɛn anki anà ukwo anki mukun'man. Làkoo anà ngwal a mbul a in'tye ye anà nde! Wöwöö!<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Aswɛŋ aŋin'naaŋ a mɛɛn mà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asɛɛn an'pɛy anà bàkɔ̈ɔ̈n asà làkyän aba unsà in'naaŋ mpa myàfàlam, wɛɛ amu Nzam, awà afipà un'kàbɔ a indiir, ntɔn bi imɛn un'sak unsà bya. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Aswɛŋ ba bàkyer yàŋàbwaŋ, bàkäl aŋin'naaŋ unsà isal a ntsà, bàkäl aŋun'kääb, aŋun'tüüb. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Abun, ba bàsàköŋà un'naaŋ a ntsà anà wàngwal ntɔn taaŋ làsàyà ungö, ntɔn musàwal mɔ̈ɔ̈ a ndandaa.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Ɔ Tumàtɛ, kaar ubwaŋàbwaŋ an'lɔɔŋ manswà bapɛ. Tiin an'yääm màkɔ̈ɔ̈n ndöŋ anà mpa màfàlab làkwikilà, anà mbaaŋ ayà un'yɛnà un'be. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Baar amwɛy abà bàswɛŋ ngaal naa ba bye anà un'yenà un'be awà, ba bàkyàdiimà mbwo a làkwikilà. Wɛy kab a ngway a Nzam làkäl anä ngye!<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
